{"id":"5542074dd5640c1f","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CombRawRow.md","title":"CombRawRow","display":"CombRawRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"CombRawRow","parameters":["z2172","z2173","z2174"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"CombRawRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>z2172</span><span>z2173</span><span>z2174</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：System F 固定组合代数与 PER 语义。有序参数：<code>z2172</code>、<code>z2173</code>、<code>z2174</code>。</p>\n<p>SK 组合项及指标变量；与应用图的集合参数分离。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ CombRawRow z2172 z2173 z2174)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists t\n  (and\n    (= z2174 t)\n    (or\n      (@ CombK t)\n      (or\n        (@ CombS t)\n        (or\n          (exists z2177 (and (@ Nat z2177) (@ TVar z2177 t)))\n          (exists z2178\n            (exists z2179\n              (and\n                (@ TApp z2178 z2179 t)\n                (and\n                  (exists z2180 (exists z2181 (and (in z2180 z2173) (and (@ App z2172 z2180 z2181) (= z2181 z2178)))))\n                  (exists z2182 (exists z2183 (and (in z2182 z2173) (and (@ App z2172 z2182 z2183) (= z2183 z2179))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"59a386a959a99335\" href=\"?note=59a386a959a99335\" title=\"ZFC_CombK\">CombK</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6940244b87569fc3\" href=\"?note=6940244b87569fc3\" title=\"ZFC_CombS\">CombS</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8ee8586c4703b19e\" href=\"?note=8ee8586c4703b19e\" title=\"ZFC_TApp\">TApp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"00213bb93d499434\" href=\"?note=00213bb93d499434\" title=\"ZFC_TVar\">TVar</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ CombRawRow z2172 z2173 z2174)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_CombK|CombK]]；[[ZFC_CombS|CombS]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TVar|TVar]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_CombK","status":"resolved","id":"59a386a959a99335","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_CombK|CombK]]；[[ZFC_CombS|CombS]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TVar|TVar]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_CombS","status":"resolved","id":"6940244b87569fc3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_CombK|CombK]]；[[ZFC_CombS|CombS]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TVar|TVar]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Nat","status":"resolved","